HOW TO OPEN NEUROLEARN-X

1. Right-click NeuroLearn-X-Shareable.zip.
2. Select Extract All.
3. Open the extracted folder.
4. Double-click Open NeuroLearn-X.exe.
5. If Windows displays a warning, verify that the file came from the official researchers before continuing.
6. Log in using your assigned Student or Teacher account.

An internet connection is required because NeuroLearn-X uses a secure online database and recommendation server.

