SUPPORTED DEVICES
- Windows 10 or Windows 11: Open NeuroLearn-X.exe, Chrome, or Edge
- Android phones and tablets: Chrome or the installed NeuroLearn-X PWA
- iPhone and iPad: Safari, then Share > Add to Home Screen
- macOS, Linux, and ChromeOS: current Chrome, Edge, Firefox, or Safari

LOGIN
Use only the participant code and password assigned by the authorized research team.
Do not share credentials or save them on a shared computer.

PRIVACY
Shared links contain only the public NeuroLearn-X address. Sign out after use,
especially on a shared device. Do not copy participant records outside the
approved research workflow.

